1. **`shutdown()` doesn't destroy `battleChannel`** — when Phaser shuts down the scene (e.g., when another scene.start() is called), the channel leaks. `goBack()` does destroy it, but `goToBattle()` calls `destroyImmediate()` before `scene.start()`. What about if the scene is shut down unexpectedly (e.g., browser refresh)?

